  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Pattern Standard?\n\n[process a URLPatternInit](https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#process-a-urlpatterninit) does:\r\n\r\n> Set baseURL to the result of [parsing](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-parser) init[\"[baseURL](https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-urlpatterninit-baseurl)\"].\r\n\r\nWhich has blob handling, which does not seem required. This seems like it should be changed to invoke the basic URL parser instead: https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-basic-url-parser",
